OL,3,GNEWSAOxygen pumped into castle moat to
OL,4,Asave fish
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxygen was pumped into a castle moat
OL,7,Fafter reports of fish in distress, the
OL,8,FEnvironment Agency has said.
OL,10,FOfficers from the authority were called
OL,11,Fto Kirby Muxloe Castle in
OL,12,FLeicestershire on August 30 and found a
OL,13,F"very low" dissolved oxygen level in
OL,14,Fthe moat.
OL,16,FEnglish Heritage, which oversees the
OL,17,Fcastle, said oxygen pumps were used for
OL,18,Fabout two weeks to help the fish.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
