OL,3,GNEWSAOxygen pumped into castle moat to
OL,4,Asave fish
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for English Heritage
OL,7,Fsaid the Environment Agency "suggested
OL,8,Fthat hot weather followed by
OL,9,Fthunderstorms may have contributed to
OL,10,Flow oxygen levels."
